# 🦈 Day 25 – AI Shark Tank Simulator

> ABTalks 60-Day Coding Challenge

## 🚀 Project Overview

The AI Shark Tank Simulator is an interactive entrepreneurship application where founders pitch their startup ideas to AI-powered investors. The simulator evaluates business concepts across multiple parameters and generates realistic investor feedback, funding decisions, and improvement suggestions.

This project demonstrates how Large Language Models can be used for startup validation, investment analysis, and entrepreneurial learning.

---

## 🎯 Features

* Startup Pitch Submission
* AI Investor Panel
* Market Opportunity Analysis
* Business Model Evaluation
* Revenue Model Review
* Competitive Advantage Assessment
* Risk Analysis
* Funding Recommendation
* Investor Questions
* Pitch Scorecard
* Final Investment Decision

